{"id":"n90875-1-9","stage":5,"title":"가장자리 · 边","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90875-1-9-1","ko":"이 사진에서는 네 얼굴이 안 보여.","zh":"这张照片里看不见你的脸。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진에서는","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸，面孔，脸部","explanation":"얼굴：脸，面孔，脸部；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"84427","definition":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸，面孔，脸部","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"有眼睛、鼻子、嘴的头的前面部分。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"可见，看得到","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"某种结果出来。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5381808bfb16e13da846.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90875-1-9-2","ko":"맨 뒷줄 가장자리에 서 있어서 그래.","zh":"因为我站在最后一排最边上。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맨","meaning":"最，头","explanation":"맨：最，头","readings":[{"term":"맨","audio":"/audio/7ec4b331b5617833973d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65109","senseId":"1","lemma":"맨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒷줄","meaning":"后排，后行","explanation":"뒷줄：后排，后行","readings":[{"term":"뒷줄","audio":"/audio/0f16af10e50d097aa07d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50923","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가장자리에","meaning":"边，边缘","explanation":"가장자리：边，边缘；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가장자리","audio":"/audio/02835e9df3dc7ea615ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90875","senseId":"1","lemma":"가장자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서","meaning":"站，站立","explanation":"서다：站，站立；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"1","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ec4b331b5617833","term":"맨","zh":"最，头","audio":"/audio/7ec4b331b5617833973d.mp3","entryId":"65109","definition":"第一，无比的。","pronunciation":["맨ː"]},{"id":"0f16af10e50d097a","term":"뒷줄","zh":"后排，后行","audio":"/audio/0f16af10e50d097aa07d.mp3","entryId":"50923","definition":"后面的一排。","pronunciation":["뒤ː쭐","뒫ː쭐"]},{"id":"02835e9df3dc7ea6","term":"가장자리","zh":"边，边缘","audio":"/audio/02835e9df3dc7ea615ce.mp3","entryId":"90875","definition":"某个东西的周边或末端部分。","pronunciation":["가ː장자리"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"站，站立","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"人或动物把脚放在地上，使身体挺直。","pronunciation":["서다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/22e864a0bf8317a4821d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.29,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90875","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":157,"sequenceScore":3.1167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这张照片里看不见你的脸。","因为我站在最后一排最边上。","把伞往上举一点吧。这样我就不会被雨淋到了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这张照片里看不见你的脸。","因为我站在最后一排最边上。","把伞往上举一点吧。这样我就不会被雨淋到了。"],"answer":1}]}
